					"kind": "text",
					"text": "<!-- @format -->\n\n## 0.4.15\n\n### Patch Changes\n\n- Align CI/CD workflow and package configuration with pnpm, perform explicit auth handshake on connect, export WSLike type, add request timeouts and generic CRUD types, and improve connection close and error handling.\n\n## 0.4.13\n\n### Patch Changes\n\n- <!-- @format -->\n\n  fix error\n\n# @xernerx/websocket"
